  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Users attempting to run VRChat reasonably struggle to optimize their game beyond configurations the developers allow on launch. \nWith better configurability by giving more features to VRChat's config file (e.g. Anti-aliasing, Level of detail, in-game FPS cap), owners of problematic PC's could solve a decent amount of FPS drops and issues to meet the peak of their CPU's performance headroom.",
